            "review_title": "Review at SumoBBQ Huynh Thuc Khang",
            "review_text": "Trần T\n17 contributions\n0\nExcellent!\nMar 2015\nThis is my family's favorite BBQ restaurant.\nFood is wonderful. Meat is fresh, especially beef. I don't think salmon is suitable for BBQ but my parents always order it. \nIf you get a combo from 200.000 - 300.000VND per person, you will have a full package of salads, vegetables, meat, desserts, drinks and ice cream.\nI really enjoy their service. These staffs are friendly and polite. They even don't feel annoy when our kids run around :)\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2015\nGolden Gate Restaurant Group\nThank you for your kind and positive respond about our restaurant. We hope to see you again at Sumo BBQ!!!\nWritten July 13, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
